    "detailed_description": "Sphere 3 combines a wide range of PvP features and a well-developed scenario line in the style of classic fantasy. The plot includes more than 1000 quests, revealing a history of confrontation between factions, full of political intrigues and betrayals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/72891d59b7661253aa848c56560f8147.poster.avif?t=1750071064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/72891d59b7661253aa848c56560f8147.webm?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/72891d59b7661253aa848c56560f8147.mp4?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>From the very beginning of the game, you will be able to take part in massive PvP: epic castle sieges for characters of different levels, battle arenas, battlefields and battles that boil literally in every corner of the game world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/7d2e1e27d3b9970d144e339f1e4fbec8.poster.avif?t=1750071064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/7d2e1e27d3b9970d144e339f1e4fbec8.webm?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/7d2e1e27d3b9970d144e339f1e4fbec8.mp4?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>However, if hardcore is not to your liking, nothing prevents you from choosing a peaceful life in PvE mode, and no one will dare to attack you without permission.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/223b7abab293fee15434cca87119d649.poster.avif?t=1750071064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/223b7abab293fee15434cca87119d649.webm?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/223b7abab293fee15434cca87119d649.mp4?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A convenient non-target awaits you in the game: the object of attack is determined using the scope. Such a control system gives a high degree of freedom for experienced warriors, but at the same time it is convenient and understandable for beginners.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/87d77d46d1d9039c42d233ac2bb2a064.poster.avif?t=1750071064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/87d77d46d1d9039c42d233ac2bb2a064.webm?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/87d77d46d1d9039c42d233ac2bb2a064.mp4?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>World-encompassing PvP zone: the battles between players, clans, alliances and factions can take place in most gameplay areas. Watch your back \u2014 danger may lurk behind every corner. <br></li><li>Hardcore non-targeting combat system: \u00abSphere 3\u00bb combat gives players unprecedented freedom, features dynamic damage calculation mechanic and allows you to switch between different types of attacks thanks to a special color-coded target indicator.<br></li><li>Performance won't be a problem: modest system requirements and make \u00abSphere 3\u00bb an ideal place for PvP massacres on a massive scale.<br></li><li>Equal opportunities: the items from in-game store can be obtained by completing in-game quests, acquiring special coins and exchanging them for premium goods at a special vendor.    <br></li><li>One of the game's defining features is castle sieges \u2014legendary, challenging, truly exciting: to capture a castle, the attacker needs to acquire siege engines and complete a number of prerequisites. Espionage and cross-clan intrigues make sieges even more fascinating! <br></li><li>Brutal yet fair PK (Player Kill) and player karma systems: PK is not penalized in free PvP zones but a character with negative karma risks losing both gold and personal items. <br></li><li>9 unique classes! Choose a combat tactic and stick to it \u2014 throw yourself into the fray, protect your allies, neutralize key enemy targets by using stealth or burn enemies to crisp with magic fire\u2014 you decide! Each class has unique advantages, and it is up to you to take advantage of them 100%.  <br></li><li>Various PvE activities: a crafting system, dangerous dungeons, world bosses that require advanced tactics to defeat, global cooperative missions taking players behind the enemy lines and much more.<br></li><li>Engaging crafting system: the best crafters in the game will never lack for customers, but becoming one is not going to be easy!<br></li><li>The long-awaited sequel that took the best features from the original Sphere \u2014 a good way to satisfy your nostalgia while enjoying constant updates and modern graphics!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Sphere 3 combines a wide range of PvP features and a well-developed scenario line in the style of classic fantasy. The plot includes more than 1000 quests, revealing a history of confrontation between factions, full of political intrigues and betrayals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/72891d59b7661253aa848c56560f8147.poster.avif?t=1750071064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/72891d59b7661253aa848c56560f8147.webm?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/72891d59b7661253aa848c56560f8147.mp4?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>From the very beginning of the game, you will be able to take part in massive PvP: epic castle sieges for characters of different levels, battle arenas, battlefields and battles that boil literally in every corner of the game world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/7d2e1e27d3b9970d144e339f1e4fbec8.poster.avif?t=1750071064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/7d2e1e27d3b9970d144e339f1e4fbec8.webm?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/7d2e1e27d3b9970d144e339f1e4fbec8.mp4?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>However, if hardcore is not to your liking, nothing prevents you from choosing a peaceful life in PvE mode, and no one will dare to attack you without permission.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/223b7abab293fee15434cca87119d649.poster.avif?t=1750071064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/223b7abab293fee15434cca87119d649.webm?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/223b7abab293fee15434cca87119d649.mp4?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A convenient non-target awaits you in the game: the object of attack is determined using the scope. Such a control system gives a high degree of freedom for experienced warriors, but at the same time it is convenient and understandable for beginners.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/87d77d46d1d9039c42d233ac2bb2a064.poster.avif?t=1750071064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/87d77d46d1d9039c42d233ac2bb2a064.webm?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/397040/extras/87d77d46d1d9039c42d233ac2bb2a064.mp4?t=1750071064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>World-encompassing PvP zone: the battles between players, clans, alliances and factions can take place in most gameplay areas. Watch your back \u2014 danger may lurk behind every corner. <br></li><li>Hardcore non-targeting combat system: \u00abSphere 3\u00bb combat gives players unprecedented freedom, features dynamic damage calculation mechanic and allows you to switch between different types of attacks thanks to a special color-coded target indicator.<br></li><li>Performance won't be a problem: modest system requirements and make \u00abSphere 3\u00bb an ideal place for PvP massacres on a massive scale.<br></li><li>Equal opportunities: the items from in-game store can be obtained by completing in-game quests, acquiring special coins and exchanging them for premium goods at a special vendor.    <br></li><li>One of the game's defining features is castle sieges \u2014legendary, challenging, truly exciting: to capture a castle, the attacker needs to acquire siege engines and complete a number of prerequisites. Espionage and cross-clan intrigues make sieges even more fascinating! <br></li><li>Brutal yet fair PK (Player Kill) and player karma systems: PK is not penalized in free PvP zones but a character with negative karma risks losing both gold and personal items. <br></li><li>9 unique classes! Choose a combat tactic and stick to it \u2014 throw yourself into the fray, protect your allies, neutralize key enemy targets by using stealth or burn enemies to crisp with magic fire\u2014 you decide! Each class has unique advantages, and it is up to you to take advantage of them 100%.  <br></li><li>Various PvE activities: a crafting system, dangerous dungeons, world bosses that require advanced tactics to defeat, global cooperative missions taking players behind the enemy lines and much more.<br></li><li>Engaging crafting system: the best crafters in the game will never lack for customers, but becoming one is not going to be easy!<br></li><li>The long-awaited sequel that took the best features from the original Sphere \u2014 a good way to satisfy your nostalgia while enjoying constant updates and modern graphics!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Who are you - a warrior or a mage? Or maybe you prefer to sneak in the dark with a dagger? Realistic castle sieges and ancient monsters, exciting battles, convenient non-targeting, with which everything depends on your dexterity, an exciting crafting system and many ways to develop your character!",
